# Copy to .env and fill in. Vite only exposes variables that start with VITE_.
VITE_ATS_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8000
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Not Vite's: scripts/corpus.ts reads a GitHub token for the corpus from its environment, never
# from this file, when gh is not logged in, as in CI. Never give either the VITE_ prefix.
# GH_TOKEN=
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Not Vite's either: the model's key, one line with no spaces, a SoCLaaS key (clsk_...) from
# https://soclaas-portal.comp.nus.edu.sg (decision 0036). The reading service's route that labels an
# imported PDF's lines, /v1/label (milestone 3 second pass, item 13; scripts/serve-label.ts in the
# dev server, functions/v1/label.ts on Pages), reads it from this file or the environment, on the
# server side alone; with none it refuses and the page's rules read the PDF. PDF_LABEL_MODEL picks
# its model by its SoCLaaS id, qwen3.8:27b when unset. `pdf-model` (scripts/pdf-model.ts), run by
# hand on the invented sets alone, reads both from its environment. Never give either the VITE_
# prefix, which would put the key in the page.
# SOCLAAS_API_KEY=
# PDF_LABEL_MODEL=
